\engtitle{.. Durva Yugalarpana Stotram ..}##
\itxtitle{.. dUrvAyugalArpaNastotram ..}##\endtitles ##
shrImanma~Ngalama~NgalaM gaNapati brahmaNyadevaM kaviM
jyeShThaM shreShThatamaM vareNyamamR^itaM vighnebhapa~nchAnanam |
tvAM sarvepsitadaM praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 1||
brahmAnandarasAmbudhiM guNanidhiM dhIR^iddhisiddhIshvaraM
sindUrAruNavigrahaM trinayanaM sadbhaktahR^inmodakam |
tvAM gaurIshasutaM praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 2||
o~NkArAdimabIjakAraNamanirvAchyaM jagatkAraNaM
yogIhR^itkamalaM prabodhanakaraM bhAnuM bhavApaddharam |
tvAM bhAlendumahaM praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 3||
udyadbhAskarakoTibhApratimabhaM divyA gadAla~NkR^itaM
vighneshaM vikaTaM vishAlajaTharaM mandArapuShpapriyam |
tvAM trailokyapatiM praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 4||
hastairyaH satataM varAbhayasR^iNIparshUnvahantaM mudA
shUrpashrotrakamambujekShaNamaghaughadhvAntavaikartanam |
tvAmAmnAyanidhiM praNamya gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 5||
shuNDAgre dhR^itamodakaM pramuditaM sanmUShikena dhvajaM
nUpUrAdikirITakuNDaladharaM devaM mahAtundilam |
tvAM sa~NkaShTaharaM praNamya  manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 6||
dAnadrAvilagaNDamaNDalayugaM modAhR^ibhrAmaraM
bhaktAriShTachinaShTivigrahadharaM shrIvakratuNDaM muhuH |
tvAM vAgIshamahaM praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 7||
AshApUrakamadrirAjatanayAsatkukShishuktyudbhavaM
DhuNDhiM kShipravarapradAnasumukhaM chintAmaNiM siddhidam |
tvAM vidyAmbunidhiM praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 8||
bhUtAnAM prabhAvApyayAvanaguNAnAmAdibIjaM paraM
bhAtyastipriyanAmarUpagaNapaM nairguNyasaukhyAspadam |
tvAM sarvArtiharaM praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 9||
herambaM bhavaghoramUlavipinaM dhvAntArtivichChedakaM
sadyastApaharaM sudhAkaramanantAnantalIlAspadam |
tvAM sarvaj~namahaM praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 10||
IDyaM shreShThatamaM guruM gurutamaM shrIjyeShTharAjaM kaviM
pUrNAnandasudhApayonidhishayaM dhIprerakaM dyotakam |
tvAM praj~nAnaghanaM praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 11||
dhyeyaM brahmasanAtanaM yaduditaM gANeshavidyAchaNaiH
vedaj~naiH suvivichya tattvamasi vAkyArthasya sandarshakaiH |
tattatvaM tvamiti praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 12||
yaH kAshigR^ihe.avatIrya shishubhiH lIlAM jagatpAvanIM
kR^itvA devanarAntakAdi ditijAn hatvAharadbhUbharam |
tvAM ballALamahaM praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 13||
AhuryaM munayo.anuvipratamamityAdyaM kavInAM kaviM
kAryaM prAkR^itikaM vichitramakhilaM no bhAsate yadR^ite |
taM tvAmekaradaM praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 14||
saMhR^ityAtmani yaH prasuptisamaye vishvaM samagraM tvidaM
shete svAtmasukhArNave suvitate sheShAkhyatalpe shubhe |
tvAM svAtmAbhiramaM praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 15||
dhyAtvA tvAM hR^idaye mayA parichitA no mAntrikI tAntrikI
dIkShAdIkShitashikShitAkathamahaM syAM tvatkR^ipAbhAjanam |
tvAM chittArttiharaM praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 16||
bhaktAstvAM karuNaM tvamevamiti yat nityaM bruvanti sphuTaM
taddIne mayi chAtake.alpamatike tUrNa kR^ipAM varShaya |
tvAM bhUtIshamahaM praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 17||
ShaTpa~nchAshatadhAShTadhA cha dashadhA bhUtvA punaH pa~nchadhA
kAshyAM ShoDashadhA cha yo nivasati shrIvishvanAthapriyaH |
tvAM lIlAttatanuM praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 18||
dUrvAla~NkaraNaM tayA pratidinaM dUrvAvanAntashcharaM
dUrvAtalpashayaM shirasyapi tathA dUrvAkirITodvaham |
tvAdUrvAttahR^idaM praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyai tattvama~NgIkuru || 19||
dUrve tvAM praNamAmyahaM mayi kR^ipAMs kurvAshu mAtarvibhuM
madvij~naptyurarIkR^itau nijapati svApekShayA prArthaya |
te.atiprItikarastavaiva vachasA gandhAkShatairsaMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyaH svIkarotyadbhutam || 20||
(yA prItirmamajAyate.ativimalA dUrvA~Nkurairarchake
sA naikAkSharavidyayA cha yajato chAnyaiH kutaH sAdhanaiH |
shrutvaitadvachanaM praNamya manasA gandhAkShataiH saMyutaM
dUrvAyugmamidaM mayArpitamibhAsyaH svIkarotyadbhutam || 21||
ye dUrvAyugalArpaNastutimimAM shrImadgaNeshapriyAM
dhyAtvA svAtmani ma~NgalAlayamamuM bhaktyA paThanti prage |
te vai vaishravaNopamAstribhuvane bhaktyA tu saukhyaM mahat
gANeshaM padamApnuvanti na punaH pashyanti garbhAlayam || 22||)


iti bR^ihadviShNuyAmale dUrvAyugalArpaNastotraM sampUrNam |
